"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（1）下方（1分）、减少（1分）\n(2) ①等压变化,"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{V_{0}+Sl_{1}}{T_{1}}=\\frac{V_{0}+Sl_{2}}{T_{2}}, l_{2}=0.20\\ \\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)\n②"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = Q + W, W = -p_{1}S(l_{2} - l_{1}), p_{1} = \\frac{p_{0}S - mg}{S}, Q = 2.4\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）\n（3）AD（2分，少选得1分，有错选得0分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--hangzhou-yimo-2411-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--hangzhou-yimo-2411","source_question_id":"hangzhou-yimo-2411-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"82ebab226da37a7ff86f20925d117d21d7eda5a0d17e6e7d8b54a04cc6b5fb1e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. （11分）某固定装置的竖直截面如图所示，由倾角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta=37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的直轨道 AB，半径 R=1 m、圆心角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"2\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" 的圆弧 BCD，半径为 R、圆心角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" 的圆弧 DE 组成，轨道间平滑连接。在轨道末端 E 点的右侧光滑水平地面 FG 上紧靠着质量 M=0.5 kg 的滑板 b，其上表面与轨道末端 E 所在的水平面齐平。水平地面上距滑板右侧足够远处固定有挡板 GH，滑板 b 与其碰撞时会立即被锁定。质量为 m=0.5 kg 的物块 a 从轨道 AB 上距 B 高度为 h=0.3m 处以初速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 下滑，经圆弧轨道 BCD 滑上轨道 DE。物块 a 与轨道 AB 间的动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{1}=0.5"},{"type":"text","value":" ，与滑板 b 间的动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{2}=0.2"},{"type":"text","value":" 。(其他轨道均光滑，物块 a 视为质点，不计空气阻力， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin37^{\\circ}=0.6"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos37^{\\circ}=0.8"},{"type":"text","value":" )。\n（1）若初速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=0"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求物块a\n①第一次通过 D 点时速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{D}"},{"type":"text","value":" 大小；\n②在轨道 AB 上运动的总路程 S。\n(2) 若物块 a 能沿轨道冲上滑板 b，则\n① "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 应满足什么条件？\n②滑板 b 至少要多长，物块 a 一定不会碰到挡板 GH?\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/fc2ad101545597e390cae0acb5f05f7127191fc4