}{2}mv_{D}^{2}-mgR(1-\\cos\\theta)"},{"type":"text","value":"物块在滑板上运动，在刚滑上滑板到与滑板共速的过程中，由动量和能量守恒，"},{"type":"math","value":"m v _ {E} = (m + M) v _ {1}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_ {2} m g l _ {1} = \\frac {1}{2} m v _ {E} ^ {2} - \\frac {1}{2} (m + M) v _ {1} ^ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"滑板被锁定后，物块继续滑动，由能量守恒，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_ {2} m g l _ {2} = \\frac {1}{2} m v _ {1} ^ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"故滑板长度最小为"},{"type":"math","value":"L=l_{1}+l_{2}=0.75m"},{"type":"text","value":"（3分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--hangzhou-yimo-2411-q19","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--hangzhou-yimo-2411","source_question_id":"hangzhou-yimo-2411-q19","number":"19","order":19,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"95cfa84597a3e223b2fbbd633c934d2b06364ddaa811bc7ce95f72ada8c416cc","body":[{"type":"text","value":"19. （11分）如图所示的装置左侧是法拉第圆盘发电机，其细转轴竖直安装。内阻不计、半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"r = 0.5 \\mathrm{~m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的金属圆盘盘面水平，处于竖直向上的匀强磁场 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 中，磁感应强度 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1} = 4 \\mathrm{T}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。圆盘在外力作用下以角速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega = 6 \\mathrm{rad/s}"},{"type":"text","value":" 逆时针（俯视）匀速转动，圆盘的边缘和转轴分别通过电刷 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 与光滑水平导轨 "},{"type":"math","value":"M_{1} N_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"M_{2} N_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 相连，导轨间距 "},{"type":"math","value":"L = 0.5 \\mathrm{~m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。在导轨平面内以 O 点为坐标原点建立坐标系 "},{"type":"math","value":"x O y"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴与导轨平行。 "},{"type":"math","value":"x < 0"},{"type":"text","value":" 区域内存在竖直向下的匀强磁场，磁感应强度 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2} = 1 \\mathrm{T}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，导电性能良好的导轨上放置着一根质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1} = 0.5 \\mathrm{~kg}"},{"type":"text","value":