ype":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 射出电场，之后保持电场不变。电场右侧存在方向垂直纸面向外、磁感应强度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 的匀强磁场。电场和磁场被与 "},{"type":"math","value":"ZO"},{"type":"text","value":" 方向垂直的挡板 "},{"type":"math","value":"D"},{"type":"text","value":" 隔离，挡板 "},{"type":"math","value":"D"},{"type":"text","value":" 上开有一小圆孔，圆心在 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 点，半径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 。通过小孔的离子进入磁场后经偏转打在荧光屏上，其余被挡板吸收并中和，已知入射速度最大的离子打在荧光屏上距 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 点的距离为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{3}{5}l"},{"type":"text","value":" 。已知 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin 37^{\\circ}=0.6"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos 37^{\\circ}=0.8"},{"type":"text","value":" ，忽略场的边界效应、离子的重力和离子间的相互作用。\n（1）求该离子的比荷 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{q}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n(2) 求离子在电场中运动时加速度 a 的大小;\n（3）若距 O 点距离为 y 处进入磁场的离子速度与 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 方向夹角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\tan \\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":" 与 y 的关系；\n(4) 若 b<<l，求荧光屏上被离子击中的区域长度s。[提示：当 "},{"type":"math","value":"x\\to0"},{"type":"text","value":" 时， "},{"type":"math","value":"(1+x)^{n}\\approx1+nx"},{"type":"text","value":" ]\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/9d7284a0c29aa85642fd0efcec5128c8750e6a5f13a78596ea6af5a548f7eb4a.png","width":839,"height":711,"width_mm":98.502,"row_group":"hangzhou-yimo-2411-q20-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第20题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"20.（1）"},{"type":"math","value":"r = \\frac{mv_0}{qB}"},{"type":"math","value":"2r = \\frac{3}{5} l"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{q}{m} = \\frac{10v_0}{3Bl}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）\n（2）以 O 为坐标原点、以"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"方向为 x 轴正向、以电场方向为 y 轴正向建坐标系\n在"},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":"方向上："},{"type":"math","value":"l = v_{0}t"},{"type":"text","value":"在"},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":"方向上："},{"type":"math","value":"-\\frac{l}{2}\\tan \\theta = -\\frac{1}{2} at^2"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"a=\\frac{3v_{0}^{2}}{4l}"},{"type":"text","value":"（3分，其他方法合理也给分）\n（3）在 x 方向上："},{"type":"math","value":"l = v \\cos \\theta \\cdot t"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {x} = v \\cos \\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"在"},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":"方向上："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y} = -v\\sin \\theta + at"},{"type":"math","value":"\\tan \\alpha = \\frac {v _ {y}}{v _ {x}} = \\frac {- v \\sin \\theta + a t}{v \\cos \\theta} = - \\tan \\theta + \\frac {a t ^ {2}}{l}"},{"type":"math","value":"y = \\frac {l}{2} \\tan \\theta - \\left(v \\sin \\theta \\cdot t - \\frac {1}{2} a t ^ {2}\\right) = - \\frac {l}{2} \\tan \\theta + \\frac {1}{2} a t ^ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"得："},{"type":"math","value":"y = \\frac{l}{2}\\tan \\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"即："},{"type":"math","value":"\\tan\\alpha=\\frac{2y}{l}(y<b)"},{"type":"text","value":"（3分，其他方法合理也给分）\n（4）设粒子进入磁场位置距 O 点距离为 y，速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v'"},{"type":"text","value":"，打在荧光屏上位置距 O 点距离为 Y\n因"},{"type":"math","value":"\\tan\\alpha=\\frac{v_{y}}{v_{x}}=\\frac{-v\\sin\\theta+at}{v\\cos\\theta}=-\\tan\\theta+\\frac{al}{(v\\cos\\theta)^{2}}=-\\tan\\theta+\\frac{al}{v_{x}^{2}}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\text{得} v _ {x} = \\frac {v _ {0}}{\\sqrt {1 + \\frac {8 y}{3 l}}} = v _ {0}  (1 + \\frac {8 y}{3 l} ) ^ {- \\frac {1}{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"由于"},{"type":"math","value":"y < b \\ll l"},{"type":"text","value":"，近似可得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_x = v_0(1 - \\frac{4y}{3l})"},{"type":"text","value":"则："},{"type":"math","value":"Y = y + \\frac{2mv'}{qB}\\cos \\alpha = y + \\frac{2mv_x}{qB} = y + \\frac{2mv_0}{qB}\\left(1 - \\frac{4y}{3l}\\right) = \\frac{3}{5} l + \\frac{1}{5} y"},{"type":"text","value":"可知："},{"type":"math","value":"Y_{min} = \\frac{3}{5} l, Y_{max} = \\frac{3}{5} l + \\frac{1}{5} b"},{"type":"text","value":"故"},{"type":"math","value":"s=\\frac{1}{5}b"},{"type":"text","value":"（3分，其他方法合理也给分）"}]}}]}
